{"unit_id":"lijiaqi-AI-Product-Manager__dsh-bug-gps#card-zh","repo":"lijiaqi-AI-Product-Manager/dsh-bug-gps","commit":"cc0753e3cc4d8e76fa11e7ed9ab4f1bbd50084aa","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bug-gps 是面向 DSH Web 与 headless 环境的浏览器问题复现和修复验证插件。它向 DSH 注册工具与技能：先让用户在真实浏览器中重现问题并标记正确预期，再把步骤锁成带内容哈希保护的案例，最后在当前代码上重放并对照锁定时的失败证据。工具还能列出案例状态；录制会将草稿写入项目的 .buggps 目录，密码和令牌字段不会保存。适合希望把界面缺陷转成可重复回归检查的开发者；需要 Node.js 和可访问的开发服务器，不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/index.js:17-50","src/dsh/tools.js:137-160","src/dsh/tools.js:269-275"]}
{"unit_id":"lijiaqi-AI-Product-Manager__dsh-bug-gps#card-en","repo":"lijiaqi-AI-Product-Manager/dsh-bug-gps","commit":"cc0753e3cc4d8e76fa11e7ed9ab4f1bbd50084aa","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-bug-gps records browser bugs and verifies fixes in DSH web/headless. It saves user-recorded steps and expected results as a hashed case, then replays them against current code. Drafts go under .buggps without passwords or tokens. For UI regression checks; needs Node.js and a development server.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh/index.js:17-50","src/dsh/tools.js:137-160","src/dsh/tools.js:269-275"]}
